<!-- ============ 요금 & 정산 ============ -->
<section class="reveal mt-10">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
    <span class="text-3xl">💸</span>
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl"><span class="marker">요금은 어떻게?</span></h2>
  </div>

  <!-- 핵심: 모든 비용 1/N -->
  <div class="sticker mt-4 p-5 text-center" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e8fbff,#fff)">
    <p class="font-round text-[15px]">아래 비용을 <b>전부 합쳐서</b></p>
    <div class="font-display text-5xl text-[var(--coral)] my-1">1 / N</div>
    <p class="font-round text-[15px] leading-relaxed">총비용을 <b>똑같이 나눠 내요!</b></p>
    <div class="mt-4 font-round text-[15px] leading-relaxed bg-[var(--foam)] rounded-2xl p-3">
      🎟️ 입장료 ＋ 🏖️ 평상 ＋ 🛒 장보기(고기 등)<br>
      <b class="text-[var(--ocean)]">= 총비용 ÷ 인원</b>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 확정 단가 (6월 평일) -->
  <p class="font-round text-sm text-[var(--pool)] mt-5 ml-1">💡 통일워터파크 <b>6월 평일 확정 요금</b>이에요 (6/19은 금요일!)</p>
  <div class="sticker mt-2 p-5 space-y-3 font-round text-[15px]">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span>🎟️ 입장권 (성인·소인)</span><b class="font-display text-lg">1만원</b></div>
    <div class="h-px bg-[var(--ink)]/10"></div>
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span>🏖️ 방갈로 (대)</span><b class="font-display text-lg">3만원</b></div>
    <div class="h-px bg-[var(--ink)]/10"></div>
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span>🏖️ 방갈로 (중)</span><b class="font-display text-lg">2만원</b></div>
    <div class="h-px bg-[var(--ink)]/10"></div>
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span>🪵 평상·테이블</span><b class="font-display text-lg">1만원</b></div>
    <div class="h-px bg-[var(--ink)]/10"></div>
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span>🛒 장보기 (고기·식재료 등)</span><b>현장 정산</b></div>
    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--pool)] pt-1">* 소인 = 12개월~초등학생, 중학생부터는 대인 요금</p>
  </div>
</section>
